  <data key="d7">This document acts as a source map detailing the specifications related to instruction fetching and related memory operations within the system.

## Overview

This specification defines the mechanisms governing instruction retrieval, memory interfaces, and access protocols.

## Key Topics

### Instruction Fetch
Details concerning the core process of instruction fetching, as specified in the source material.

### Branch Prediction
Information related to the mechanisms employed for branch prediction during instruction execution.

### Instruction-Side Memory Interface
Specification of the interface used for accessing memory directly from the instruction stream or related structures.</data>
