# Pipeline Stages

Pipeline stages represent the distinct phases or components within the overall data processing pipeline. Understanding these stages is crucial for configuring the pipeline correctly and managing instruction flow.

## Overview

Detailed information regarding the overall structure and configuration of the pipeline is documented in the source document [[pipeline_details_rst]].</data>
